4. THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS
   Oikos includes third-party components distributed under their own licences,
   which continue to apply to those parts. Home Assistant is a trademark of its
   respective owners; this project is not affiliated with or endorsed by them.

5. NO WARRANTY
   The software is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind, express or
   implied, including merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose and
   non-infringement. To the extent permitted by law, the author shall not be
   liable for any damages arising from the use of, or inability to use, the
   software.

6. TERMINATION
   Failure to comply with these terms immediately terminates the right to use the
   software and may be pursued through the competent courts.

For permissions beyond those granted here: https://homeoikos.com
